Updated April 2026
Alice DuVivier (duvivier@ucar.edu)

Data processing notebooks and analysis for project examining how environmental changes near Utqiagvik, Alaska may impact whaling activities

Data processing is for four datasets:
- CESM1-LE
- CESM2-LE
- CESM2-CMIP5
- MESACLIP

Data analysis is for figures for the manuscript

Data is both model and observational data used in manuscript
